{"id":"83adc13498d19c2f","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-normal-function.md","title":"正规序数类函数","display":"df-normal-function — 正规序数类函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-normal-function","aliases":["18-df-normal-function"],"display":"df-normal-function — 正规序数类函数","depends_on":["[[18-df-ordinal]]","[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]","[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Definition 3.2.18; total-domain specialization","source_pages":"27","source_pdf_pages":"37","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-normal-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-normal-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-function — 正规序数类函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 3.2.18; total-domain specialization"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"27"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"37"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 是可定义的全类函数；类、类函数及其图均为元理论中的可定义类缩写，不作为 ZFC 中集合量词的取值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f91b518237a8b\" href=\"?note=592f91b518237a8b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal-comparison\">18-df-ordinal-comparison</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbde69396a089d39\" href=\"?note=dbde69396a089d39\" title=\"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal\">18-df-successor-limit-ordinal</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> 为下式定义的全类函数正规性谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}\\;f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}f(\\xi)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}\\;f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}f(\\xi)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 §3.2.18 的全域特例；原书还处理以正则序数 κ 为参数的部分 κ-normal 函数。本节点仅定义全域正规性，不把两种接口混为一谈。每个集合大小初段上的函数限制是集合；后续不动点枚举采用可定义类图。新增前已查本书全部序数条目与相关 Fix/Enum 节点，未有此复用接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是可定义的全类函数；类、类函数及其图均为元理论中的可定义类缩写，不作为 ZFC 中集合量词的取值。$\\mathrm{Ord}$、$<$、$\\mathrm{Lim}$ 分别见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]、[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"592f91b518237a8b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是可定义的全类函数；类、类函数及其图均为元理论中的可定义类缩写，不作为 ZFC 中集合量词的取值。$\\mathrm{Ord}$、$<$、$\\mathrm{Lim}$ 分别见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]、[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-successor-limit-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"dbde69396a089d39","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是可定义的全类函数；类、类函数及其图均为元理论中的可定义类缩写，不作为 ZFC 中集合量词的取值。$\\mathrm{Ord}$、$<$、$\\mathrm{Lim}$ 分别见 [[18-df-ordinal]]、[[18-df-ordinal-comparison]]、[[18-df-successor-limit-ordinal]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\ \\leftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\alpha<\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)<f(\\beta))\\bigr)\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Lim}\\;f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi<\\lambda}f(\\xi)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-normal-function]]"},{"id":"86c6b889a83607ba","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 是可定义全类函数，$\\mathrm{Normal}(f)$；$\\mathrm{Normal}$ 见 [[18-df-normal-function]]。$\\mathrm{Fix},\\mathrm{Enum},\\mathrm{IncEnum}$ 分别见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]、[[18-df-well-order-enumeration]]。"},{"id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cdc1f90088d43701","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Normal}$ 见 [[18-df-normal-function]]。"},{"id":"92f365ec0f2e26f3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}$ 为可定义全类函数，$\\mathrm{Normal}(f)$，见 [[18-df-normal-function]]；$\\mathrm{Fix}$ 见 [[18-df-fixed-point-set]]。类函数参数及其图均为元理论缩写，不对真类作集合量化。"},{"id":"243363d27f588e48","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Normal}$ 见 [[18-df-normal-function]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-normal-function]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-normal-function]]"}],"outgoing":["cf95026e035bcb2b","592f91b518237a8b","dbde69396a089d39"]}